<title>USA: Omaha hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts slow, not fully developed, early sales $0.50 lower. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3   220-260 lbs    56.75-57.00</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Uneven, little changed. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-500 lbs	    46.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    48.00-48.50, few 49.00</p>
